Order Confirmation: <%= @order.order_number %>

Thank you for your order!

Order Details:
--------------
<% @order_items.each do |item| %>
<%= item.product_name %><%= " (#{item.variant_details})" if item.variant_details.present? %> x <%= item.quantity %>: <%= number_to_currency(item.subtotal, unit: @order.currency + " ") %>
<% end %>

Subtotal: <%= number_to_currency(@order.subtotal, unit: @order.currency + " ") %>
Shipping: <%= number_to_currency(@order.shipping_cost, unit: @order.currency + " ") %>
Total: <%= number_to_currency(@order.total, unit: @order.currency + " ") %>

Shipping Address:
-----------------
<%= @order.shipping_name %>
<%= @order.shipping_address %>
<%= @order.shipping_city %>, <%= @order.shipping_postal_code %>
<%= @order.shipping_country %>

We'll notify you once your order has been shipped.